# oracle: fix qeq/dynamic with the documented loose tolerance 1e-3 on an irregular 5-atom cluster (coul/cut), 30 nve steps: the mean |f| stopping test, the iteration count f_q and the charges follow native
# oracle-inputs: w36qeq_param.qeq2
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units metal
atom_style charge
boundary p p p
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 20
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 single 5.0 5.0 5.0
create_atoms 2 single 7.3 5.4 5.2
create_atoms 1 single 9.1 6.8 4.6
create_atoms 2 single 5.6 7.9 6.1
create_atoms 2 single 8.2 8.6 5.5
mass 1 28.0855
mass 2 15.9999
set atom 1 charge -0.3
set atom 2 charge 0.5
set atom 3 charge -0.6
set atom 4 charge 0.2
set atom 5 charge 0.2
pair_style coul/cut 8.0
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 1.0 bin
fix q all qeq/dynamic 1 8 1.0e-3 200 w36qeq_param.qeq2
compute qa all property/atom q
compute qmax all reduce max c_qa
compute qmin all reduce min c_qa
thermo_style custom step pe c_qmax c_qmin f_q
thermo_modify format float %.15g
velocity all create 600.0 52817
fix 1 all nve
timestep 0.001
thermo 2
run 30
